From fff0cf515b0c33a9075678db04a768040eea4a39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:05:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Image size: unused pages and libraries out, brand images
 WebP, portal photos rescaled

- The stock Captive Portal editor, Guest_network and their helpers are not shipped where the
  Network page replaces them; their old addresses land on the Network page. Three superseded pages
  and their scripts go.
- Libraries no program or plugin loads are removed from the image, and the 64-bit DNS name-service
  library that cannot load.
- The logo, the Operation Mode picture and this model's header and animated header ship as WebP;
  the PNGs go.
- Portal background photos are scaled to 1280 by 720 at quality 75 where that is smaller; the
  phone-as-modem help is not shipped (nothing links to it).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
